## 1. Objective
Currently, while the WebGPU Canvas timeline scrolls seamlessly, the text editor's playback highlight lacks clear visual hierarchy, precision, and theater-level focus—making dense scores with many tracks difficult to track.

This contract replaces the previous basic delta decorations with an incredibly rich **Theater-Spotlight Karaoke** highlight system:
